                  <textarea id="contractTerms" rows="6" placeholder="Enter additional terms, payment schedule details, warranties, etc..." style="width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 2px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; font-family: inherit;"></textarea>
